1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,200
Welcome to Bill Aura ERP and Billing SaaS platform.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:08,800
In this session, you will learn how to navigate your workspace with maximum speed.

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:13,600
At the very top of your screen is the Global Header Bar.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,500
Use the central Search Bar to find invoices, customers, and items instantly.

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,800
The gold Quick Create button gives you 1-click access to all core business vouchers.

6
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:28,400
The Organization Switcher allows seamless switching between companies and branches.

7
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:33,500
Notice the Workspace Tab Bar directly beneath the header.

8
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:38,200
You can open multiple documents in tabs without losing your active form state.

9
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:43,500
Use the collapse button on the sidebar to maximize space for wide accounting tables.

10
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,500
Press Control plus Slash at any time to open the Command Palette.
